      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我总觉得两天也要带很多东西。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "其实一个小包就够了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "衣服要带几套？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "一套换的就可以，天气也不冷。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "雨伞要不要带？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "天气预报说可能有小雨，带一把比较好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "充电器也不能忘。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，不过不用带电脑。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我刚想把电脑放进去。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这次是休息，不是出差。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "你说得对。那我只带手机和耳机。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "身份证和车票信息也确认一下。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "已经放好了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "鞋子穿舒服的，不用带第二双。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样包真的很轻。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "走很多路的时候你会感谢现在的自己。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我不再加东西了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc032_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那早点儿睡，明天别迟到。",
